          </div>
          <div class="pill">
            Designing APIs with clear contracts, validation at the boundary, and structured error handling.
          </div>
          <div class="pill">
            Picking up new domains quickly and delivering reliable systems across frontend, backend, and client platforms.
          </div>
        </div>
